    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just Do Eat - Survival Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive in a world of natural selection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Eat, Escape, Evolve.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your survival journey in a microscopic corner of the universe. Hunt creatures weaker than you while cleverly avoiding stronger ones to grow and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense survival action with simple touch controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic growth through three evolution paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your organism with unique skills and parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless challenges and ranking system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own survival strategy as you evolve towards supremacy. Can you become the ruler of this micro cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It is not the strongest of the species that survives, nor the most intelligent. It is the one most adaptable to change.&quot;</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just Do Eat - Survival Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive in a world of natural selection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Eat, Escape, Evolve.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your survival journey in a microscopic corner of the universe. Hunt creatures weaker than you while cleverly avoiding stronger ones to grow and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense survival action with simple touch controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic growth through three evolution paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your organism with unique skills and parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless challenges and ranking system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own survival strategy as you evolve towards supremacy. Can you become the ruler of this micro cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It is not the strongest of the species that survives, nor the most intelligent. It is the one most adaptable to change.&quot;</i></p>",
